  (text "BTS7960 (IBT-2) H-bridge module drives two TEC1-12706 Peltiers (40x40 mm) in series from +12V_SW (about 6 V / 3 A each, better efficiency). RPWM = heat/cool one way, LPWM = the other."
    (at 25 144.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 1b2b0b20-e1b7-4fa9-ba7b-25e0ece35357))
  (text "TEC_EN goes to R_EN and L_EN; Q701 pulls it low on FAULT. The thermostat on the Power sheet also removes +12V_SW."
    (at 25 148.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid d4fafa4d-07e8-49ae-a96e-2b4d97fa2832))
  (text "Check that the IBT-2 logic accepts 3.3 V inputs when powered from 5 V; if not, add a 74HCT245 level shifter."
    (at 25 153.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid e78fcfdb-8592-4c20-9682-f03a17b1e8a5))
  (text "Q702 (IRLZ44N, TO-220) switches both 12 V fans (load heatsink, Peltier hot side) with PWM from PA8. J705 is an always-on 5 V mixing fan inside the pocket."
    (at 25 157.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid af91c5ac-bb02-49e6-ab1c-550c73bc4022))
  (no_connect
    (at 91.44 41.91)
    (uuid 5d1c0a3e-7b2f-4c61-9a0e-1f3b2c4d5e61))
  (no_connect
    (at 91.44 44.45)
    (uuid 5d1c0a3e-7b2f-4c61-9a0e-1f3b2c4d5e62))  (text "v0.3 REVIEW NOTES - explained in docs/SCHEMATIC_GUIDE.md section 7; checklist with comment columns in docs/SCHEMATIC_REVIEW.md"
    (at 25 166.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5) bold)
      (justify left top))
    (uuid ef121289-6432-46df-b540-1e9c45d2caf8))
  (text "v0.3: option (a) - BTS7960 sits in the thermal unit and the Peltiers wire straight to its M+/M-. J703 removed; J702 pins 3/4 not connected."
    (at 25 171.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 1f779378-5e3f-40e8-83eb-5e417f719f4f))
  (text "How it works: BTS7960 = H-bridge; RPWM/LPWM choose cool/heat and power. TEC_EN (R701, R702 pull-down) is forced low by Q701 on FAULT."
    (at 25 176.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 77befb7a-eed5-4671-af25-514c22c382eb))
  (text "CHECK T-01: IBT-2 input buffer (74HC244 at 5 V) may not accept 3.3 V logic.  T-02: IRLZ44N driven with 3.3 V."
    (at 25 180.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid cee49be9-6f85-4272-9796-4dfcb30f1639))
